2. GENERATIVE AI

Generative AI = Generative Artificial Intelligence

Generative AI creates new content.

It can generate:

Text
Images
Audio
Video
Code
Documents

Traditional ML:

"Is this email spam?"

Generative AI:

"Write an email to the customer."

Examples

ChatGPT → Text

DALL-E → Images

GitHub Copilot → Code

Gemini → Text/code/images depending on model capabilities

How Generative AI works

A simplified architecture:

User Prompt
     ↓
AI Model
     ↓
Understand Context
     ↓
Generate Tokens
     ↓
Final Response
